      - 'Укороченная куртка'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_jacket_cindy.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Leather cut short, metal at the seams.'
      - 'Кожа, обрезанная по рёбрам, металл по швам.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_top_cindy.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Halter Bikini Top'
      - 'Верх бикини на завязках'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_top_cindy.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Ties behind the neck. That is the whole design.'
      - 'Завязывается за шеей. В этом вся конструкция.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_briefs_cindy.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Bikini Bottom'
      - 'Низ бикини на завязках'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_briefs_cindy.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'In a set with the top.'
      - 'В пару к верху.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_shorts_cindy.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Buttoned Shorts'
      - 'Шорты на пуговице'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_shorts_cindy.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Short, plain, one button. Nothing to break.'
      - 'Короткие, простые, одна пуговица. Ломаться нечему.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_top_osiris.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Field Top'
      - 'Полевой топ'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_top_osiris.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Plain, tight, made to go under gear.'
      - 'Простой, в облипку, чтобы надевать под снаряжение.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_shorts_osiris.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Field Shorts'
      - 'Полевые шорты'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_shorts_osiris.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'In a set with the top.'
      - 'В пару к топу.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_belt_cindy.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Hip Belt'
      - 'Пояс на бедро'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_belt_cindy.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Wide, low on the hip, metal fittings.'
      - 'Широкий, низко на бедре, с металлом.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_gloves_cindy.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Short Gloves'
      - 'Короткие перчатки'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_gloves_cindy.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'To the wrist. Keeps the palms off hot metal.'
      - 'До запястья. Спасают ладони от горячего металла.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_boots_cindy.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Heeled Boots'
      - 'Сапоги на каблуке'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_boots_cindy.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'To the knee, on a heel. Someone chose these for a city.'
      - 'До колена, на каблуке. Их выбирали для города.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_boots_osiris.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Combat Boots'
      - 'Берцы'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_boots_osiris.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Flat, laced, made for walking all day.'
      - 'Плоские, на шнуровке, для целого дня на ногах.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_gloves_osiris.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Wrist Wraps'
      - 'Напульсники'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_gloves_osiris.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Wrapped from wrist to forearm.'
      - 'Намотаны от запястья до предплечья.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_belt_holster.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Holster Belt'
      - 'Пояс с кобурой'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_belt_holster.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'An empty holster on a thigh strap. The gun is someone else''s story.'
      - 'Пустая кобура на бедренном ремне. Ствол — уже чужая история.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.gear_backpack_osiris.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Field Pack'
      - 'Полевой рюкзак'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.gear_backpack_osiris.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Small and flat. Holds a day, not a week.'
      - 'Маленький и плоский. На день, не на неделю.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_necklace_osiris.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Chain Necklace'
