      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_socks_fit_blue.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Ankle Socks (Blue)'
      - 'Носки (Blue)'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_socks_fit_blue.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Plain and short. Worn until they are not.'
      - 'Простые и короткие. Носятся, пока носятся.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_socks_fit_blue2.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Ankle Socks (Blue2)'
      - 'Носки (Blue2)'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_socks_fit_blue2.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Plain and short. Worn until they are not.'
      - 'Простые и короткие. Носятся, пока носятся.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_glasses_nerd.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Round Glasses'
      - 'Круглые очки'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_glasses_nerd.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Thick rims and thicker lenses. The world comes into focus.'
      - 'Толстая оправа и линзы толще. С ними мир наводится на резкость.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_blouse_nerd.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'School Blouse'
      - 'Школьная блузка'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_blouse_nerd.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Buttoned, pressed, and sleeved to the wrist. Tidier than her week.'
      - 'На пуговицах, отглажена, рукав до запястья. Опрятнее, чем её неделя.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_bowtie_nerd.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Bow Tie'
      - 'Галстук-бабочка'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_bowtie_nerd.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Tied at the throat. Holds no heat and no blade — it is there to be seen.'
      - 'Завязана на горле. Ни тепла, ни защиты — она чтобы её видели.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_sneakers_nerd.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Canvas Sneakers'
      - 'Кеды'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_sneakers_nerd.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Soft soles, laced high. Quiet, and no use at all in the wet.'
      - 'Мягкая подошва, высокая шнуровка. Тихие и совершенно бесполезные в сырость.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_kneesocks_nerd.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Knee Socks'
      - 'Гольфы'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_kneesocks_nerd.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'To the knee, ribbed. More warmth than they look like they hold.'
      - 'До колена, в рубчик. Греют больше, чем кажется.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_tutu_nerd.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Tutu Skirt'
      - 'Юбка-пачка'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_tutu_nerd.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Layers of netting that stand out on their own. Warms nothing.'
      - 'Слои сетки, что держат форму сами. Не греет совсем.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_sportsbra_tek.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Sports Bra'
      - 'Спортивный лиф'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_sportsbra_tek.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Firm and plain. Made to be forgotten while running.'
      - 'Плотный и простой. Сделан, чтобы о нём не думали на бегу.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_jackettied_tek.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Jacket Tied at the Waist'
      - 'Куртка на поясе'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_jackettied_tek.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Sleeves knotted at the hip. Carried, not worn — until it turns cold.'
      - 'Рукава завязаны на бедре. Не надета, а с собой — пока не похолодает.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_jacket_tek.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Training Jacket'
      - 'Тренировочная куртка'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_jacket_tek.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Zipped, light, and warmer than it looks. Wind stops at it.'
      - 'На молнии, лёгкая и теплее, чем кажется. Ветер об неё останавливается.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_yogapants_tek.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Yoga Pants'
      - 'Легинсы'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_yogapants_tek.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Full length and close to the skin. Warm, and they tear on the first thorn.'
      - 'В полную длину, по коже. Тёплые — и рвутся о первый же шип.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_briefs_flair.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Silk Briefs'
      - 'Шёлковые трусики'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_briefs_flair.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Worn against the skin. She notices when they are gone.'
      - 'На голое тело. Без них замечает сразу.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_pumps_flair.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Pumps'
      - 'Лодочки'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_pumps_flair.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'A high heel and nothing else. Worn where the ground is flat and swept.'
      - 'Высокий каблук и больше ничего. Для пола, который ровный и подметён.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_skirt_flair.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Pencil Skirt'
      - 'Юбка-карандаш'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_skirt_flair.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Straight, to the knee. Looks better than it lets her move.'
      - 'Прямая, до колена. Выглядит лучше, чем позволяет двигаться.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_sweater_flair.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Knit Sweater'
      - 'Вязаный свитер'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_sweater_flair.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Loose knit, off one shoulder. The warmest thing that is not a coat.'
      - 'Крупная вязка, с одного плеча. Самое тёплое, что ещё не пальто.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_gloves_fit.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Training Gloves'
      - 'Тренировочные перчатки'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_gloves_fit.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Padded across the knuckles. For grip, and for hitting things.'
      - 'С подбивкой на костяшках. Для хвата и для ударов.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_croptop_fit.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Crop Top'
      - 'Укороченный топ'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_croptop_fit.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Cut off above the ribs. Thin, and she likes it.'
      - 'Обрезан выше рёбер. Тонкий, и ей нравится.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_shorts_fit.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Running Shorts'
      - 'Беговые шорты'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_shorts_fit.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Light and short. Nothing between her legs and the weather.'
      - 'Лёгкие и короткие. Между ногами и погодой ничего.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_socks_fit.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Ankle Socks'
      - 'Носки'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.underwear_socks_fit.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Plain and short. Worn until they are not.'
      - 'Простые и короткие. Носятся, пока носятся.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_armwraps_primal_sleeve1.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
